{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And Aaron shall wave the Levites as a wave-offering.</b> Just as a guilt-offering of a metzora requires a live wave-offering — three wave-offerings are stated in this passage: the first — for the sons of Kohath, therefore it is said of them ״וְהָיוּ לַעֲבֹד אֶת עֲבֹדַת ה׳״, because the service of the Holy of Holies was upon them — the ark and the table, etc.; the second — for the sons of Gershon, therefore it is said of them ״תְּנוּפָה לַה׳״, because the service of the Sanctuary was also upon them — the curtains and clasps seen within the Holy of Holies; and the third — for the sons of Merari."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:57.483593236Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}